# Auto-generated decision digests (regenerated via post-checkout / post-merge hooks).
# Two files with different jobs: DIGEST.md is the always-loaded orientation layer,
# DIGEST-full.md the complete index. See 2026-10-15-digest-orientation-layer.
docs/decisions/DIGEST.md
docs/decisions/DIGEST-full.md
.safety-patches/

